sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant API
    participant Stripe
    participant Webhook
    participant DB
    participant Email

    User->>Frontend: Access account settings
    Frontend->>API: Get subscription status
    API->>DB: Fetch user subscription data
    DB-->>API: Subscription details
    API-->>Frontend: Display subscription info
    
    alt Manage Subscription
        User->>Frontend: Click "Manage Billing"
        Frontend->>API: Request billing portal
        API->>Stripe: Create portal session
        Stripe-->>API: Portal URL
        API-->>Frontend: Redirect URL
        Frontend->>User: Redirect to Stripe portal
        User->>Stripe: Make changes (e.g., cancel)
        Stripe->>Webhook: subscription.updated event
        Webhook->>DB: Update subscription status
        Webhook->>Email: Send status update email
        Email-->>User: Confirmation email
    end
    
    alt Cancel via API
        User->>Frontend: Click "Cancel Subscription"
        Frontend->>API: DELETE /subscription
        API->>Stripe: Update subscription (cancel_at_period_end)
        Stripe-->>API: Updated subscription
        API->>DB: Update cancellation status
        API-->>Frontend: Success message
        Frontend-->>User: Display confirmation
    end